<title>USA: U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CST - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CST - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boxed beef steady to weak on mostlymoderate demand and offerings. Select and Choice rib and loin cutsgenerally steady, while chuck and round cuts weak. Fresh beef trimmings generally steady on light to moderate demand and offerings. - USDA</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>287 Fab Lds  CH 1-3	CH 1-3	SE 1-3	SE 1-3</p>
